| `Injector` | The `Injector` in which to create the isMutating signal. If this is not provided, the current injection context will be used instead (via `inject`). |\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: InjectIsMutatingOptions\ntitle: InjectIsMutatingOptions\n---\n\nDefined in: [packages/angular-query-experimental/src/inject-is-mutating.ts:16](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/angular-query-experimental/src/inject-is-mutating.ts#L16)\n\nOptions for `injectIsMutating`, passed after the mutation filters.\n\n## Properties\n\n| Property | Type | Description |\n| ------ | ------ | ------ |\n| <a id=\"property-injector\"></a> `injector?` | `Injector` | The `Injector` in which to create the isMutating signal. If this is not provided, the current injection context will be used instead (via `inject`). |\n"}
